WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.068
Peter hopped through the woods.

2
00:00:07.069 --> 00:00:18.405
A path led to the farmer's gate.

3
00:00:18.406 --> 00:00:26.605
Peter squeezed under the gate and looked around.

4
00:00:26.606 --> 00:00:41.110
"I see green leaves everywhere!" said Peter.

5
00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:49.468
Peter wandered through the garden.

6
00:00:49.469 --> 00:00:52.066
He ate some lettuce.

7
00:00:52.067 --> 00:01:03.142
He ate some green beans.

8
00:01:03.143 --> 00:01:10.565
He ate some radishes.

9
00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:15.267
"These vegetables are delicious!" said Peter.

10
00:01:15.268 --> 00:01:21.519
"I'll eat some more."

11
00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:26.939
Then he hopped around a corner.

12
00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:30.857
Peter gasped. "The farmer!"

13
00:01:30.858 --> 00:01:35.477
The farmer gasped. "A rabbit!"

14
00:01:35.478 --> 00:01:37.466
Peter ran.

15
00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:41.201
The farmer grabbed his rake.

16
00:01:41.202 --> 00:01:45.748
He chased Peter.

17
00:01:45.749 --> 00:01:49.767
"Stop, thief!" cried the farmer.

18
00:01:49.768 --> 00:01:52.553
He swung his rake at Peter.

19
00:01:52.554 --> 00:01:55.747
Peter ran as fast as he could.

20
00:01:55.748 --> 00:02:00.559
His heart beat fast.

21
00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:09.080
He lost one shoe near the cabbages.

22
00:02:09.081 --> 00:02:14.940
He lost his other shoe near the potatoes.

23
00:02:14.941 --> 00:02:18.267
"Where's the gate?" cried Peter.

24
00:02:18.268 --> 00:02:22.664
He looked around.

25
00:02:22.665 --> 00:02:25.754
Suddenly he ran into a net.

26
00:02:25.755 --> 00:02:29.201
The big buttons on his jacket got caught.

27
00:02:29.202 --> 00:02:32.557
"Ahh!" cried Peter.

28
00:02:32.558 --> 00:02:36.855
He kicked and twisted.

29
00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:39.490
But it was no help.

30
00:02:39.491 --> 00:02:48.399
"I'm stuck in the farmer's net!" cried Peter.

